  "verdict": {
    "text": "The registry's current submission for this Party is NDC 3.0, filed 2025-07-17. 53 observed values are loaded from DS-02 (11), DS-35 (35), DS-40 (7). For 2024 the sources disagree: DS-02 0 MtCO₂e, DS-35 0 MtCO₂e. They are on different inventory scopes and the engine does not reconcile them. No implementation gap is reported: 35 observed years are loaded, but no NDC target emissions figure has been parsed, so there is nothing to measure the trend against. Projected warming for 2080-2099 against 1995-2014 ranges from +0.68°C under SSP1-2.6 to +2.64°C under SSP5-8.5. These are model runs, not observations.",
    "clauses": [
      {
        "field": "ndc_registry.submission_date",
        "text": "The registry's current submission for this Party is NDC 3.0, filed 2025-07-17."
